      "id": "character_lucia",
      "slug": "lucia",
      "title": "Lucia Caminos",
      "description": "Lucia Caminos learned to fight from her father at an early age, and life has continued to test her ever since. Protecting her family ultimately led to time in the Leonida Penitentiary, but after her release she is determined to build a better future through careful planning rather than reckless choices. Inspired by the life her mother always dreamed of since their days in Liberty City, Lucia is prepared to take control of her own destiny. Together with Jason, she sees a chance to change the odds in her favor.",
