      "slug": "jason",
      "title": "Jason Duval",
      "description": "Jason Duval has spent most of his life surrounded by grifters and criminals. Hoping to leave his troubled past behind, he enlisted in the Army, but eventually found himself back in familiar territory, working for drug runners in the Florida Keys. Jason longs for a simpler, more stable life, yet every decision seems to pull him deeper into danger. Meeting Lucia may be his greatest opportunity for a fresh start—or the beginning of an even more complicated future.",
